OL,3,GNEWSA'Every day is difficult' says
OL,4,AAshley Dale's mum four years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a woman shot dead by a
OL,7,Fgunman who was targeting her boyfriend
OL,8,Fhas told how "every day is difficult",
OL,9,Ffour years on.
OL,11,FAshley Dale, 28, was murdered on 21
OL,12,FAugust 2022 when James Witham burst
OL,13,Finto her Liverpool home and began
OL,14,Ffiring a Skorpion sub-machine in search
OL,15,Fof her partner, in a drugs feud.
OL,17,FHer mum, Julie Dale, said: "August is a
OL,18,Fdifficult time for us but I just think
OL,19,Fevery day is difficult."
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
